      "our_answer": [
        3
      ],
      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "In neutral or faintly alkaline medium, MnO4- is reduced to MnO2. Iodide is oxidised to iodate: 2MnO4- + H2O + I- → 2MnO2 + 2OH- + IO3-."
    },
    {
