      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Statement I: 4FeCr2O4 + 8Na2CO3 + 7O2 → 8Na2CrO4 + 2Fe2O3 + 8CO2, so it is correct. Statement II: 3MnO4^2- + 4H+ → 2MnO4- + MnO2 + 2H2O gives 2 mol MnO4- and 1 mol MnO2, so the statement has them reversed and is incorrect."
