      "blind_answer": 2,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Th has the configuration [Rn]6d2 7s2, so it has no 5f electron. Am is 5f7 7s2, U is 5f3 6d1 7s2 and Cm is 5f7 6d1 7s2."
    },
